  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>A smooth brown stone the size of a plum, taken from the stomach of an animal nobody has been able to name. It is lighter than it looks, and it floats in wine but sinks in water.</p><p>While you carry this stone, you have Immunity to Poison damage and to the Poisoned condition.</p><p><strong>The Stone's Touch.</strong> Once per day, as an action, you touch the stone to a creature. Every poison and disease in it ends, and it regains [[/heal 8d8]] Hit Points. The stone regains this power at dawn.</p><p><strong>The Black Cup.</strong> Dropped into a shared cup, the stone turns black if anyone at the table means the drinker harm. It does not say who. It turns white again only when that person leaves the room or changes their mind.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
